s/M87V2DU9" ref="dc:subject"><desc>florilegium</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/M87V2DU9" ref="dc:subject"><desc>historiography</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/M87V2DU9" ref="dc:subject"><desc>translations from Greek</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/M87V2DU9" ref="dc:subject"><desc>translations into Syriac</desc></relation></listRelation></body></text></TEI>